  "id": "baked-chicken-drumsticks",
  "name": "Baked Chicken Drumsticks",
  "subtitle": "Oven-roasted drumsticks with cumin and smoked paprika",
  "description": "Chicken drumsticks are coated in olive oil and a savory spice mixture, then baked until browned and safely cooked through.",
